		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>This perfectly formed, luminescent humanoid is sheathed in a rippling halo. Star archons are generals and tacticians.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16 (+1 plate mail), <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 +2 longsword +8 (1d8+2) or magic circle, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Divine Aura</strong>. Hostile spells targeting the archon are DC 15. Sword and armor dissolve if slain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Magic Circle</strong>. Cast magic circle, automatic success.</p><p></p><p><strong>Protostar Rebirth</strong>. If slain, creatures within double near of archon CON 18+ or 5d6 damage. Archon reforms as a lesser archon in 1d4 days.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
